{"id":"vod_sn_38631","vodId":"38631","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Weiss Survive","name_cn":"Weiss Survive","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/58480bdccf8c6b35f75e4ce0b4ad0f6b.jpg"},"summary":"由株式会社Bushiroad企划的TCG（交换卡片游戏）项目，早在2008年夏季就开始在全国派发免费情报杂志「Bushiroad TCGMagazine」上连载由藤真拓哉主笔的漫画「Vice・Survive」，今年6月将被改编成每话2分半钟的短篇动画，并作为TBS的人气偶像节目「卡片学园」中的插播动画播出。对于这次动画化，说白了其实就是带点广告性质的动画短剧。　　动画版中，除了主角武和美知外，也将预定数位动画原创角色登场。主角武的声优是由该卡片游戏节目中的讲师中本顺久担任，女主角・美知的声优则由在节目中报告秋叶原情报等的橘田泉担任。人设原案藤真拓哉是在「魔法先生NEO」（与「魔法先生」世界观平行的故事，但漫画主笔不同）中有出色表现的藤真拓哉，其清新细腻的画风相当吸引人。而曾执导过「吉永家的石像怪」「HAPPY★LESSON」的铃木行将出任动画监督一职。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2cU5wtZ58t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5VvzbJpNf11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8RXx4AZ3Aj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qsKck47PbU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hJ0htdsmnR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/daX3w1CNr61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VhwGwRXHRw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3sqe50Radf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QWv1d35Nwt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vvqAaL1vYV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rUxc4hi3hz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gdMCMjtexV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x63Wcrx4qa1/video/